 names. The company was formerly known as Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc. and changed its name to Shopify Inc. in November 2011. Shopify Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Ottawa, Canada.","fullTimeEmployees":7600,"city":"Ottawa","country":"Canada","website":"https://www.shopify.com","industry":"Software - Application","sector":"Technology"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-23"}